# ScoutConsiderthese — scratch evidence log (REBUILT after the sweep)

Rebuilt 2026-10-25 from this seat's own transcript after an external sweep removed the whole
`.ufo/waves/round-35/scratch/` tree at ~03:45 (all seat directories; `w2/reports/` intact).
Content is the original log plus the two late checks (items 16–17). The authoritative record is the
report itself: `.ufo/waves/round-35/w2/reports/ScoutConsiderthese.md` (its §2 tables and appendix A
carry every command and exit code; nothing there depends on this file).

Read-only outside this directory and the report. No installs, no pacman, no host mutation.

